{"id":"vod_bf_24529","vodId":"24529","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"男子游泳部第一季","name_cn":"男子游泳部第一季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-25/85ddd8869c64c1bf9104a0041571f99e.jpg"},"summary":"小学时期，游泳部的四名成员在毕业前的游泳比赛中夺冠，之后他们毕业的毕业，出国的出国，四人分道扬镳。时过境迁，就读岩鸢高中的七濑遥（岛崎信长 配音）和好朋友橘真琴（铃木达央 配音）升上高二，他们与昔日的游泳部成员之一叶月渚（代永翼 配音）重逢。三人回忆起小学时光，约定到曾经的游泳馆去。在废弃的游泳馆里，他们居然遇到了归国的松冈凛（宫野真守 配音）。意料之外的是，昔日战友凛性情大变，还对遥发起挑战，结果遥输给了他。　　遥、真琴和渚决定成立游泳部，经过多番努力后，终于招募到了新成员龙崎怜（平川大辅 配音），他们以县大赛冠军为目标，进行紧张的集训。另一方面，凛所在的鲛柄学院游泳部也在为大赛作准备。他们约定，要在赛场上决一高下。充满激情和活力的游泳部，在这个夏天，开始了关于友情与青春的Free!故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 09:16:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/nanziyouyongbudiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/nanziyouyongbudiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/nanziyouyongbudiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/nanziyouyongbudiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/nanziyouyongbudiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/nanziyouyongbudiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/nanziyouyongbudiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/nanziyouyongbudiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/nanziyouyongbudiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/nanziyouyongbudiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/nanziyouyongbudiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/nanziyouyongbudiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-